WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.250
Ever wonder what a roofer
actually does up there?

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.700
Right. Here's the whole visit.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.870
Joe comes out himself
and walks the roof.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:13.283
Shingles, flashing,
vents, gutters.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:16.073
He takes photos,
so you see what he sees.

00:00:16.073 --> 00:00:17.723
Then he tells you straight.

00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:20.517
Fix it, watch it,
or leave it alone.

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:22.967
It's free. No pressure.

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:26.587
And when you call?
Joe answers his own phone.

00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:28.447
